# codes:
file "alter_forms.sp" deck
  title "alter_forms"
  comment " oracle: S3-CONTROL S4: device.c:1249-1420 com_alter_common (bare value: the principal parameter, spiceif.c:951; dev p v, dev p = v, @dev[p] = v); names fold (inpcom.c:1775)"
